    "text": "utahstateaggies.com\nwebsite\nLogan\nUtah State Golf Opens Fall Season at Colorado State Tournament\n9 hours ago\nLOGAN, Utah – Utah State's golf team officially opens its 2025-26 season at the Colorado State-hosted Ram Masters Invitational on Thursday and Friday, Sept. 11-12. The 54-hole tournament will be played at the Fort Collins Country Club. The par-70 course will play at 7,234 yards. Joining the Aggies and...",
